{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">吳若希（Jinny）近日正忙於投入無綫新劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》的拍攝工作。雖然劇組日程緊密，但 Jinny 仍不忘抓緊時間放鬆身心。日前，她便趁着下雨天去到一間咖啡店，享受難得的悠閒時光，更於社交平台分享了一組極具氣質的文青靚相，為一眾網民大派福利！</p><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相片中所見，Jinny 的打扮既休閒又不失性感。她穿上一件白色喱士吊帶上衣搭配牛仔褲，外面再披上一件寬鬆牛仔外套，更刻意大玩「跌膊誘惑」，大方展露迷人的鎖骨與勻稱的身材線條，散發出濃厚的文青氣質，獲不少網民派 Like 讚好。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dc544f5f-bf5b-40c9-9a10-7f9748326bb1.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026AiH9Mi6ogu1785486459.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dc544f5f-bf5b-40c9-9a10-7f9748326bb1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5893636e-7f8d-48d2-b719-e21405950c78.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026cfA1AJ3H1b1785486460.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5893636e-7f8d-48d2-b719-e21405950c78.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h4 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h4><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了靚相吸睛，Jinny 附上的帖文內容亦相當惹笑。她幽默地「控訴」身邊的助手盈姐平日對她管教甚嚴，展現出兩人親密又搞笑的互動：「雨天☔️感恩。我助手盈姐，成日都好惡～又唔支持我 shopping，又唔俾我飲咖啡，但好難得，我搵到有樣嘢佢支持我，佢話好支持我 po 相☺️」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T09:19:16.718853+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":378,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}